the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k2dKNANbYTQQ7kNvwHhKMU5&_nc_oc=AdobrWdAzE8yPdL0DHuEUlq2HuTyDs5IDvGL-YeDNhb6OUPwU8P5Lxc4qBKHvQhcJ8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af77Il_PyXCrNi1Eoso1JIfXSAnUHbw_Odu_bPnpmFOuVw&oe=6A185E03"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uTIDqnpTwd0Q7kNvwFB0c6F&_nc_oc=Adpudl5qWOgQFhuwG4VTZBx2Hc2y2o4whL-Q9rqy7EMYx5iA5YG0zd1JY0vjujkRDuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5_2U08iffBpDsWFtY-fymI79Lq2919DPCnqhbHN95oSw&oe=6A185658"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C6tv3ZkNMkMQ7kNvwHF7Cr1&_nc_oc=AdreIkhXznVd_PiFBkfBQZ56J9NNlyFHESc0q_sWYwNGHCUizyhS0fw0kwAPb9C2w2s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5RfoB0Cbi0x9XVZcvzVPJz0P9pvK1OaVIA8tLebGxDUQ&oe=6A18313C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080